<p>
Lord,
</p>

<p>
Let me be known,
</p>

<p>
not by what I hate,<br>
but by whom I love;
</p>

<p>
not by whom I exclude,<br>
but by whom I include;
</p>

<p>
not by my enemies,<br>
but by my friends;
</p>

<p>
for an enemy truly loved<br>
is but a friend to be.
</p>


<p>
<i>Amen</i>
</p>


